msgctxt "184"
msgid "Get out there and find me a stand-in for Kuda-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "But even if I do find somebody, it's way too late!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Then how the hell are we supposed to film this thing!?\r\n"
"Without our star, we're nothin'!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "...And? What am I supposed to do about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"I feel terrible about all this. You gave me the starring\r\n"
"role, and then I had to go and break my arm in the\r\n"
"men's room..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Hey..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "What about him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Oh... He's perfect!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "You wanna be in a movie, hotshot?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "A movie? Why me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Well, Kuda here was our lead, but he got injured during\r\n"
"rehearsal... And without a lead, our hopes of completing\r\n"
"this film are pretty much screwed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Hi, there. The name's Noboru Kudarizaka, or Kuda for short."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Okay... I think I get the picture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Anyway, you've got just the face and build we're\r\n"
"looking for... In fact, I think you fit this role like a glove! So how "
"about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "(Being in a movie might not be so bad...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Sorry. Find somebody else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "But there is nobody else! This role was practically created for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Okay, I'll do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Hot damn! That just made my day!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "What kind of role is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"It's an over-the-top action scene. So basically, we need you\r\n"
"to beat the crap out of some thugs, and make it look pretty!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "I can do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "What's your name, anyway?"
msgstr ""

